HARVEST_DATE:
You are a plant harvest expert. Based on the following plant data, estimate the expected harvest date.

Plant data:
- Name: {plantName}
- Common name: {commonName}
- Family: {family}
- Category: {category}
- Planted at: {plantedAt}
- Current growth stage: {growthStage}

Return ONLY a single ISO 8601 date string (e.g. "2026-08-15T00:00:00.000Z") representing the estimated harvest date. No explanation, no markdown, no extra text.

